        "eyebrow": "THE FOUNDER STORY",
        "eyebrow_color": "navy",
        "heading": "From a bridal business to a wholesale hub",
        "body": "<p>It started in Lagos market, watching how goods were actually bought. In 2016 I started a small bridal accessories business and learned the rest order by order: sourcing, pricing, selling. That became GBL Accessories, and GBL Accessories became GBG Wholesale Hub. Same eye for product, built into something other women could buy from, sell from, and grow with.</p><p><em>Input equals output. We can hand you the stock and the roadmap. The rest is yours to build.</em></p>"
